# Top 3 — Redesign Plan

## Current State
- Types, logic, state management, PocketBase persistence all in place
- Presenter has V/→ keyboard shortcuts and buttons for voting/results/next
- Display has NameWall (names fade when voted) + AnimatedDonut results
- Player has radio-button list, confirmation, waiting screens

## Required Changes

### 1. Display — Intro phase
- Make heading much bigger (text-7xl+) and animate it in (fade + scale)
- Full-screen dark gradient background

### 2. Phone — Intro phase
- Show the fase media image (from mediaUrl prop) + heading in two lines
- Branded layout (logo band, gradient background) like Zitten en Staan

### 3. Display — Voting phase (name wall)
- Add staggered entrance animation for player names appearing
- Names already fade out when players vote — keep that

### 4. Phone — Voting phase
- Scrollable list with radio buttons (already exists)
- Filter out self (already done via localStorage playerName)
- After vote: change popup to say "Je hebt gestemd." (not "Je hebt gekozen voor: X")

### 5. Presenter — Controls
- Remove "Volgende Vraag" button
- Results button: put 'R' badge in it (like V button has V badge)
- Add 'R' keyboard shortcut to show results
- → arrow key advances to next fase (handled by display page already)

### 6. Display — Results phase
- Donut chart already exists with animation
- Shows percentages + top 3 names — keep as is

